{"2707370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Resonance", "steam_appid": 2707370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras_big/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407 width=1560 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play as Maria, a girl with mysterious telekinetic powers held in a dark government facility.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras_big/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407 width=1560 height=62 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visceral Rampage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash the full extent of Maria's powers.</strong> Use your telekinetic voice to brutally force your way through the containment complex, be it by violently flinging vulnerable enemies against walls, chucking their lifeless bodies at their compatriots, or performing devastating AoE attacks that make the ground shake. Adapt and improve in your skills as you encounter more and more obstacles on your path to freedom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras_big/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407 width=1560 height=62 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cathartic Destruction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the facility trying to control you.</strong> Pick up furniture, barriers, or enemies themselves to either use as a shield against incoming bullets or as projectiles to launch at enemies. Learn how to best combine your abilities with the environment to wreak absolute havoc on surrounding areas, channeling Maria's destructive mania.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras_big/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407 width=1560 height=62 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Dark Facility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience Dystopian Noir.</strong> Find yourself in an environment unlike any other: a dark, oppressive facility soaked in black and white that <i>you</i> seek to drench in the blood red of your captors. Push through the complex as you hear the eerie drone and metal clanking of it trying to keep you under its control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras_big/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407 width=1560 height=62 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Development Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resonance is a first-year project developed within the Creative Media and Game Technologies course at Breda University of Applied Sciences. The team of 11 students comes from a variety of countries and backgrounds, and hopes that you will enjoy this short game experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created in Unreal Engine 5.5.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras_big/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407 width=1560 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play as Maria, a girl with mysterious telekinetic powers held in a dark government facility.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras_big/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407 width=1560 height=62 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visceral Rampage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash the full extent of Maria's powers.</strong> Use your telekinetic voice to brutally force your way through the containment complex, be it by violently flinging vulnerable enemies against walls, chucking their lifeless bodies at their compatriots, or performing devastating AoE attacks that make the ground shake. Adapt and improve in your skills as you encounter more and more obstacles on your path to freedom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras_big/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407 width=1560 height=62 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cathartic Destruction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the facility trying to control you.</strong> Pick up furniture, barriers, or enemies themselves to either use as a shield against incoming bullets or as projectiles to launch at enemies. Learn how to best combine your abilities with the environment to wreak absolute havoc on surrounding areas, channeling Maria's destructive mania.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras_big/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407 width=1560 height=62 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Dark Facility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience Dystopian Noir.</strong> Find yourself in an environment unlike any other: a dark, oppressive facility soaked in black and white that <i>you</i> seek to drench in the blood red of your captors. Push through the complex as you hear the eerie drone and metal clanking of it trying to keep you under its control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/extras_big/b77d090b7bce31d6c0557cf21be54c58.webp?t=1788008407 width=1560 height=62 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Development Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resonance is a first-year project developed within the Creative Media and Game Technologies course at Breda University of Applied Sciences. The team of 11 students comes from a variety of countries and backgrounds, and hopes that you will enjoy this short game experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created in Unreal Engine 5.5.</p>", "short_description": "Wield your telekinetic voice in Resonance, a short twin-stick top-down action game. Sweep away enemies, raise and hurl objects, use them as a shield, and escape the dark facility trying to contain your powers. Nominated for Best Student Game at the Dutch Game Awards 2025.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/07601648633a89ad0a599b0aff381a76f4eedccf/header.jpg?t=1788008407", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/3b0fd8ede3da49334c8d5720c51c15b6a94e1547/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788008407", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707370/3b0fd8ede3da49334c8d5720c51c15b6a94e1547/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788008407", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Realtek High De